//! `run` expression caches exactly like a hand-written `caos-cli run`.
//!
//! ## Grammar
//!
//! One `.caos-expr` is a sequence of lines. Blank lines and `#` comments are
//! ignored. Any line but the last may bind a variable; the last line is the
//! file's *value*:
